02d34a-4ad8-562b-8457-9fd6ebf13de4" :question/id #uuid "8c02d34a-4ad8-562b-8457-9fd6ebf13de4"] ["question-8c02d34a-4ad8-562b-8457-9fd6ebf13de4" :question/math-academy-id "q-177690"] ["question-8c02d34a-4ad8-562b-8457-9fd6ebf13de4" :question/problem "The $9$th and $10$th terms of an arithmetic sequence are $49$ and $45,$ respectively. Determine the formula for the $n$th term of the sequence."] ["question-8c02d34a-4ad8-562b-8457-9fd6ebf13de4" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the $n$th term is given by \n\n$$\n{a}_{n}={a}_{1}+(n-1)d,\n$$\n\nso we need to figure out the first term ${a}_{1}$ and the common difference $d.$ \n\nSince the terms ${a}_{9}=49$ and ${a}_{10}=45$ are consecutive, we can subtract them to find the common difference:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & ={a}_{10}-{a}_{9} \\\\  & =45-49 \\\\  & =-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can use one of our known values, say, ${a}_{9}=49,$ to determine the first term of the sequence. Since ${a}_{9}$ is $8$ jumps after ${a}_{1},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{9} & ={a}_{1}+8d \\\\ 49 & ={a}_{1}+8(-4) \\\\ 49 & ={a}_{1}-32 \\\\ 49+32 & ={a}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{1} & =81.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the formula for the $n$th term of this arithmetic sequence is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{n} & ={a}_{1}+(n-1)d \\\\  & =81+(n-1)(-4) \\\\  & =81-4n+4 \\\\  & =85-4n.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-8c02d34a-4ad8-562b-8457-9fd6ebf13de4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550" :answer-field/id #uuid "4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550"] ["answer-c976b982-fbc1-5a12-9f25-15205ef6c9f3" :answer/id #uuid "c976b982-fbc1-5a12-9f25-15205ef6c9f3"] ["answer-c976b982-fbc1-5a12-9f25-15205ef6c9f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c976b982-fbc1-5a12-9f25-15205ef6c9f3" :answer/value "{a}_{n}=73-4n"] ["answer-7104255d-539a-5c5c-a1fb-11f319f0ae2e" :answer/id #uuid "7104255d-539a-5c5c-a1fb-11f319f0ae2e"] ["answer-7104255d-539a-5c5c-a1fb-11f319f0ae2e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7104255d-539a-5c5c-a1fb-11f319f0ae2e" :answer/value "{a}_{n}=76-3n"] ["answer-f148c23e-a718-5531-a0c4-1174b3fba592" :answer/id #uuid "f148c23e-a718-5531-a0c4-1174b3fba592"] ["answer-f148c23e-a718-5531-a0c4-1174b3fba592" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f148c23e-a718-5531-a0c4-1174b3fba592" :answer/value "{a}_{n}=85-4n"] ["answer-ccac4e53-8c71-5b88-9d4d-0e21df30e875" :answer/id #uuid "ccac4e53-8c71-5b88-9d4d-0e21df30e875"] ["answer-ccac4e53-8c71-5b88-9d4d-0e21df30e875" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ccac4e53-8c71-5b88-9d4d-0e21df30e875" :answer/value "{a}_{n}=89-5n"] ["answer-f1c9c8fe-e798-51ad-a501-82b5c80bac50" :answer/id #uuid "f1c9c8fe-e798-51ad-a501-82b5c80bac50"] ["answer-f1c9c8fe-e798-51ad-a501-82b5c80bac50" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f1c9c8fe-e798-51ad-a501-82b5c80bac50" :answer/value "{a}_{n}=94-5n"] ["answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550" :answer-field/correct "answer-f148c23e-a718-5531-a0c4-1174b3fba592"] ["answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550" :answer-field/choices "answer-c976b982-fbc1-5a12-9f25-15205ef6c9f3"] ["answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550" :answer-field/choices "answer-7104255d-539a-5c5c-a1fb-11f319f0ae2e"] ["answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550" :answer-field/choices "answer-f148c23e-a718-5531-a0c4-1174b3fba592"] ["answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550" :answer-field/choices "answer-ccac4e53-8c71-5b88-9d4d-0e21df30e875"] ["answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550" :answer-field/choices "answer-f1c9c8fe-e798-51ad-a501-82b5c80bac50"] ["question-8c02d34a-4ad8-562b-8457-9fd6ebf13de4" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-4d2c864f-a858-5345-a4b8-b85451a19550"] [17592186105920 :knowledge-point/questions "question-8c02d34a-4ad8-562b-8457-9fd6ebf13de4"] ["question-49006a0c-9d9b-5197-b92e-ebd835d319e8" :question/id #uuid "49006a0c-9d9b-5197-b92e-ebd835d319e8"] ["question-49006a0c-9d9b-5197-b92e-ebd835d319e8" :question/math-academy-id "q-177697"] ["question-49006a0c-9d9b-5197-b92e-ebd835d319e8" :question/problem "The $6$th and $7$th terms of an arithmetic sequence are $-37$ and $-43,$ respectively. Determine the formula for the $n$th term of the sequence."] ["question-49006a0c-9d9b-5197-b92e-ebd835d319e8" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the $n$th term is given by \n\n$$\n{a}_{n}={a}_{1}+(n-1)d,\n$$\n\nso we need to figure out the first term ${a}_{1}$ and the common difference $d.$\n\nSince the terms ${a}_{6}=-37$ and ${a}_{7}=-43$ are consecutive, we can subtract them to find the common difference:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & ={a}_{7}-{a}_{6} \\\\  & =-43-(-37) \\\\  & =-43+37 \\\\  & =-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can use one of our known values, say, ${a}_{7}=-43,$ to determine the first term of the sequence. Since ${a}_{7}$ is $6$ jumps after ${a}_{1},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{7} & ={a}_{1}+6d \\\\ -43 & ={a}_{1}+6(-6) \\\\ -43 & ={a}_{1}-36 \\\\ -43+36 & ={a}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{1} & =-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the formula for the $n$th term of this arithmetic sequence is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{n} & ={a}_{1}+(n-1)d \\\\  & =-7+(n-1)(-6) \\\\  & =-7-6n+6 \\\\  & =-6n-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-49006a0c-9d9b-5197-b92e-ebd835d319e8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-e1f7ea83-66ac-59bf-a2b2-ac35df55da76" :answer-field/id #uuid "e1f7ea83-66ac-59bf-a2b2-ac35df55da76"] ["answer-63088e18-5037-574e-ad60-35bc9c871285" :answer/id #uuid "63088e18-5037-574e-ad60-35bc9c871285"] ["answer-63088e18-5037-574e-ad60-35bc9c871285" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-63088e18-5037-574e-ad60-35bc9c871285" :answer/value "{a}_{n}=-4n-13"] ["answer-dd99c42f-293b-55c0-b44b-582a2580b93f" :answer/id #uuid "dd99c42f-293b-55c0-b44b-582a2580b93f"] ["answer-dd99c42f-293b-55c